    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Sam Kamau, a pioneer faculty member at AKU's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC), came from a humble background. Raised by a single mother in the Kenyan highlands, his mother worked hard to ensure he got a good education.",
